    "Two generated rowRel_iff simp auxiliaries appear but are not registered as default simp rules; the previously tested version exposed a further equation and is superseded.",
    "Earlier broad-tactic attempts failed or were terminated and are not counted as passing evidence.",
    "The recorded timing samples are incremental, not randomized controlled benchmarks. Historical transitive project/Foundation/package objects remain cached and no full closure or every downstream client was rebuilt.",
    "Compiled objects and original replay environment are excluded."
